I once got the candles from a bones pile and skipped the mines completely.

Sokoban is not really any big danger, IMO; play careful and you'll stay
alive. The mines, OTOH, is mostly a challenge; some character classes
should be first trained in the main dungeon before descending into the
mines. Again, it depends.

